{"violation_type":{"id":"tx-tac-746-3503-c-2","jurisdiction":"TX","state":"TX","code_system":"Texas Administrative Code, Title 26, Ch. 746","original_code":"746.3503(c)(2)","title":"Diaper Changing Equipment - If Above Floor Level Must Keep Hand on Child (26 TAC §746.3503(c)(2))","short_title":"Diaper Changing Equipment - If Above Floor Level Must Keep Hand on Child","severities":{"medium_high":28},"facility_ids":["tx-hhsc-254415","tx-hhsc-1487207","tx-hhsc-1330124","tx-hhsc-95448","tx-hhsc-159901","tx-hhsc-1159989","tx-hhsc-1346936","tx-hhsc-1347943","tx-hhsc-159110","tx-hhsc-1162062","tx-hhsc-1424467","tx-hhsc-1348214","tx-hhsc-1402133","tx-hhsc-364811","tx-hhsc-1438667","tx-hhsc-1496312","tx-hhsc-1368988","tx-hhsc-462809","tx-hhsc-1352834","tx-hhsc-212616","tx-hhsc-1383834","tx-hhsc-209020","tx-hhsc-1114656","tx-hhsc-1478669","tx-hhsc-1357781","tx-hhsc-1155902","tx-hhsc-1419133"],"first_date":"2021-12-04","last_date":"2026-09-03","typical_finding":"Based on the DFPS investigation, the caregiver had an infant on the changing table but turned around to get something behind them without keeping a hand on the infant's body.","finding_variants":[{"text":"Based on the DFPS investigation, the caregiver had an infant on the changing table but turned around to get something behind them without keeping a hand on the infant's body.","count":2},{"text":"This standard was evaluated as part of the investigation and was found to be deficient. Through interviews with staff, it was determined that a caregiver did not keep their hand on an infant who was on the diapering table.","count":1},{"text":"A caregiver turned away from the diaper changing table to throw away a diaper without having an infant secured with safety straps or a hand on a 10-month-old infant during the diaper change. This resulted in the 10-month-old falling off the changing table onto the floor.","count":1},{"text":"Based on the information gathered the caregiver in the 12 to 17 month old classroom left a child on the changing table while walking across the classroom to the trash can.","count":1},{"text":"Video evidence shows a caregiver take her hands of a child that is being changed. The table is above the floor, and no safety mechanism were being used. The child rolled and fell from the diaper changing table as a result.","count":1},{"text":"A caregiver did not use safety straps located on the diaper changing table, bent over, and removed her hand from the infant while on the changing table. The infant fell off the table and fell approximately 3 feet to the ground.","count":1}],"topic":"sanitation","topic_label":"Sanitation & hygiene","topic_evidence":"INFERRED","primary_severity":"medium_high","occurrence_count":28,"facility_count":27},"by_year":{"2021":1,"2022":5,"2023":4,"2024":6,"2025":9,"2026":3},"facilities":[{"id":"tx-hhsc-254415","name":"Discovery World Learning Center","type":"center","authority":"TX HHSC","status":"licensed","city":"San Antonio","zip":"78233","address":"6020 Fountainwood St","capacity":175,"age_groups":["infant","toddler","preschool","school_age"],"lat":29.574295704264,"lon":-98.371254360072,"inspections":27,"last_inspection":"2026-10-02","violations":43,"open_violations":0,"severe_violations":32,"occurrences_of_type":2,"open_of_type":0},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1487207","name":"The Pillars Christian Learning Center","type":"center","authority":"TX HHSC","status":"licensed","city":"Richardson","zip":"75082","address":"3501 Murphy Rd","capacity":248,"age_groups":["infant","toddler","preschool","school_age"],"inspections":24,"last_inspection":"2026-10-21","violations":16,"open_violations":0,"severe_violations":14,"occurrences_of_type":1,"open_of_type":0},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1330124","name":"First Protestant School","type":"center","authority":"TX HHSC","status":"licensed","city":"New Braunfels","zip":"78130","address":"205 S Castell Ave","capacity":251,"age_groups":["infant","toddler","preschool","school_age"],"lat":29.701089541798,"lon":-98.124137316332,"ins